OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FUS singer D4vd will stand trial for
OL,8,Fmurder over the death and
OL,9,Fdismemberment of 14-year-old Celeste
OL,10,FRivas Hernandez, after a judge ruled
OL,11,Fthere was enough evidence for it to go
OL,12,Fahead.
OL,14,FProsecutors allege Rivas Hernandez had
OL,15,Fthreatened to expose their
OL,16,Frelationship just a few days before
OL,17,Fhis debut album dropped.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
