PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,F"I will end ur career and ur life,"
OL,8,Fshe told the singer, whose real name
OL,9,Fis David Burke, in a text message sent
OL,10,Fthe night before her death.
OL,12,FLos Angeles Judge Charlaine Olmedo
OL,13,Fdecided that evidence presented during
OL,14,Fa preliminary hearing provided
OL,15,Fprobable cause for a trial on charges
OL,16,Fof murder, continuous sexual abuse of
OL,17,Fa child under 14 and unlawful
OL,18,Fmutilation of human remains.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
