PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FThe decision came following a
OL,8,Fpreliminary hearing over five days in
OL,9,Fwhich dozens of witnesses were
OL,10,Fquestioned and graphic photographic
OL,11,Fevidence was shown.
OL,13,FThe evidence included autopsy photos,
OL,14,Fexplicit descriptions and depictions
OL,15,Fof sexual abuse and the final texts
OL,16,FRivas Hernandez sent minutes before
OL,17,Fshe died.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FThe ruling was a major step in the 10-
OL,8,Fmonth investigation and prosecution of
OL,9,FD4vd that began when the dismembered
OL,10,Fand decomposing body of a girl was
OL,11,Ffound in the trunk of his Tesla in the
OL,12,FHollywood Hills in September while he
OL,13,Fwas on tour.
OL,15,FBurke, 21, showed no emotion when the
OL,16,Fjudge issued the ruling, watching
OL,17,Fcalmly and intently in his orange jail
OL,18,Fclothes and glasses as he had
OL,19,Fthroughout the proceedings.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FHe is scheduled to be charged on 31
OL,8,FAugust, with the trial set to start
OL,9,Fwithin 90 days of that date. Burke has
OL,10,Fpleaded not guilty to the charges of
OL,11,Fmurdering and sexually abusing her.
OL,13,FHis lawyers argued that the murder
OL,14,Fevidence was insufficient, but did not
OL,15,Fargue against the other two charges.
OL,16,FProsecutors argued that the evidence
OL,17,Fwas overwhelming and are weighing
OL,18,Fwhether to seek the death penalty.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FBurke, using the stage name D4vd
OL,8,F(pronounced "David"), rose to musical
OL,9,Ffame as a teen with a blend of indie
OL,10,Frock, R&B and lo-fi pop. He had huge
OL,11,Ffollowings on TikTok, SoundCloud and
OL,12,FSpotify, where his top songs,
OL,13,Fincluding his 2022 breakthrough
OL,14,F"Romantic Homicide," have more than a
OL,15,Fbillion plays.
OL,17,FIn 2024, he played the Coachella music
OL,18,Ffestival and released his first full-
OL,19,Flength album, "Withered," two days
OL,20,Fafter authorities say Rivas Hernandez
OL,21,Fwas killed.
OL,26,@pD@MOUpD@SO]vD@AOUvD@TO]{D@OOU{D@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
