PN,31907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FBefore the decision to allow the trial
OL,8,Fto go ahead, prosecutors gave a moment-
OL,9,Fby-moment account of Rivas Hernandez's
OL,10,Flast night.
OL,12,FAs she neared his Hollywood home
OL,13,Fshortly after 10pm on 23 April 2025,
OL,14,Fin an Uber he had sent to pick her up,
OL,15,Fshe sent her final text: "girly pop
OL,16,Fi'm almost there open ur door if ur
OL,17,Fhome."
OL,19,FProsecutors allege Burke stabbed her
OL,20,Fto death when she came through the
OL,21,Fdoor.
OL,26,@wD@ZOUyD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FThe night before, the two argued via
OL,8,Ftext about his relationship with a
OL,9,Fwoman. She sent him a profanity-
OL,10,Friddled text saying she would tell her
OL,11,Fdad so many lies about him and that
OL,12,Fshe would "end ur career and ur life."
OL,13,FShe had sent several similar messages
OL,14,Faround the same time.
OL,16,FProsecutors said that Burke met Rivas
OL,17,FHernandez when she was 11, began
OL,18,Fsexually abusing her when she was 13
OL,19,Fand he was 18.
OL,26,@tD@KOUtD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FThey presented that the parents of
OL,8,Fboth Burke and Rivas Hernandez knew
OL,9,Fabout their relationship, that he had
OL,10,Fattended church with members of her
OL,11,Ffamily and that her parents had given
OL,12,Ftheir consent for her to go to London
OL,13,Fwith him for a week.
OL,15,FDuring the preliminary hearing,
OL,16,Fprosecutors introduced photos of the
OL,17,Ftwo of them kissing and lying in bed.
OL,18,FThe pictures showed that she had
OL,19,F"David" tattooed in red ink on a
OL,20,Ffinger - one of two that had been cut
OL,21,Foff when her body was found.
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
