PN,31910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FProsecutors said they have records
OL,8,Fshowing Burke ordered chainsaws and
OL,9,Fpaddling pools that he used to
OL,10,Fdismember her body in his garage, and
OL,11,Fthat her DNA was found there on blood
OL,12,Fstains.
OL,14,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
