PN,31911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FThey said he then drove around for
OL,8,Fweeks and even months with the body in
OL,9,Fhis trunk before the seemingly
OL,10,Fabandoned Tesla was towed from the
OL,11,FHollywood Hills.
OL,13,FThe defence argued that the evidence
OL,14,Fdidn't show the kind of malice that
OL,15,Fwas required for murder and there was
OL,16,F" evidence of a history of violence".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FThe defence also established that she
OL,8,Fhad asked seven times to come to see
OL,9,Fhim in the days before her death, and
OL,10,Fhe reluctantly agreed only after she
OL,11,Fdemanded it, and that she had
OL,12,Fthreatened to kill Burke and to
OL,13,Fmutilate him.
OL,15,FPatrick Steinfeld, an attorney for
OL,16,FRivas Hernandez's family, said after
OL,17,Fthe hearing that they were "horrified
OL,18,Fthat the defence attorneys brought up
OL,19,Fevidence to put the blame on a 14-year-
OL,20,Fold girl."
OL,26,@yD@\OU|D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
