CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785322078
OL,3,CJudge rules US singer D4vd must face
OL,4,Cmurder trial over death of 14-year-old
OL,5,Cgirl
OL,7,FHer parents sat in the front row
OL,8,Fthrough most of the hearing, but sat
OL,9,Fout some of the more graphic parts and
OL,10,Fleft in the middle of the sexual
OL,11,Ftestimony after her mother began
OL,12,Fcrying.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
